  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Adaptation in Forest and Agricultural Mosaic Landscapes (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the resilience of productive landscapes and rural communities through organizational innovations and technology transfer for climate change adaptation.
- The Project aims to improve coordination and sharing of knowledge between key stakeholders, including local communities, district level government agencies, NGOs, and the private sector, with a view to promoting a multi-sectorial, integrated approach that is essential to addressing climate change adaptation and resilience</narrative>
  </description>
